<details class="govuk-details app-details govuk-!-margin-bottom-9" >
    <summary class="govuk-details__summary">
    <span class="govuk-details__summary-text">
      Help with notes and evidence
    </span>
    </summary>
    <div class="govuk-details__text">
        <p>Throughout your apprenticeship, you can add notes and evidence to keep a record of what you've learnt and how you've applied it in your job.</p>
        <p>You can add them in the Notes and evidence section or from an individual KSB.</p>
        <p>When you add a note or piece of evidence, you'll need to give it a title, choose a date and add a description.</p>
        <p>You can also link it to any relevant KSBs when you add it, or you can do this later.</p>
        <p>For your apprenticeship assessment, you’ll usually need to create a portfolio showing how you’ve applied your KSBs in your job. You can use the notes and evidence you've recorded to build your portfolio.</p>        
    </div>
</details>